<title>UK: Sweden sets $700 million three-year bond.</title>
<headline>Sweden sets $700 million three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Yamaichi International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SWEDEN</p>
<p> AMT	  $700 MLN  COUPON     5.60	MATURITY    27.JAN.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.13     PAY DATE    30.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.20	LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA3/AA+   DENOMS (K) 1	   SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SWEDEN</p>
<p> NOTES	SHORT FIRST COUPON. YAMAICHI IS SOLE MANAGER.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
